disclosure:
This game contains a limited amount of AI-assisted content, specifically:
* Some 3D fish models;
* A small number of ingredient icons and 3D model assets;
* Some character portrait illustrations;
* The map background UI used in the in-game app;
* Some mobile phone wallpapers;
* Some custom logos;
* Some equipment and ingredient assets used in nighttime gameplay.
Except for the content listed above, all other artwork, 3D models, UI, environments, characters, animations, sound effects, and other assets in the game were either:
* Legally purchased from publicly available commercial asset libraries and used in accordance with the applicable license agreements; or
* Originally created and produced by collaborating artists and designers.
This game was developed part-time by a two-person team outside of our regular working hours. Due to limited time and resources, some content could not be fully refined to the standard we ultimately hope to achieve. As development continues, we plan to gradually work with additional artists and designers, or personally revise and replace these assets where appropriate.

In-game illustrations are designed with AI assistance;
Character dialogue and voice tones are optimized via AI;
Integrated AI models enable free chat interactions with NPCs.

This game contains pre-generated AI content and no real-time generated AI content. Relevant information is as follows:
Tools used: Midjourney (art), GPT (text);
Application scope: Only used for the auxiliary creation of game art assets, story texts, and UI assets. All AI-generated content is used as initial drafts;
Manual review: All AI-generated content has been revised, polished, screened, and copyright-verified by a professional team to ensure originality and compliance;
Compliance guarantee: Copyright verification of AI-generated content has been completed, with no infringement risks, in compliance with Steam content guidelines and relevant laws of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region;
Content control: No real-time AI generation function. All in-game displayed content is the final version that has been pre-generated and manually reviewed, without the uncertainty of dynamically generated content.

AI (DALL-E by OpenAI: ChatGPT) was used to:
- generate the game logo;
- generate textures for physical materials (rocks, wood, etc.);
- generate shields, bushes, flags, gold chains, mosaics, and a sword;
- generate dynamite, rods, enemies, and bonuses;
This game does not use AI to live-generate content or code during gameplay.
All AI assets have undergone human post-processing.

This game uses generative AI tools in the creation of certain assets:
Some character and environment art assets were generated using developer-trained AI models;
Some ambient background music (non-vocal) was generated using commercially available AI models with proper commercial licenses;
In addition, the Steam store capsule image was also generated with the help of AI tools.
All AI-generated content is static, manually reviewed and edited by the developer prior to release, and does not involve any post-release dynamic generation.

The AI ​​content is only Windows-based content. Nothing from outside. The Functions are normal Windowsfeatures.
